,"position":{"start":{"line":164,"column":1,"offset":3923},"end":{"line":164,"column":35,"offset":3957}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":164,"column":1,"offset":3923},"end":{"line":164,"column":35,"offset":3957}}},{"type":"code","lang":null,"meta":null,"value":"anchor build --verifiable","position":{"start":{"line":166,"column":1,"offset":3961},"end":{"line":168,"column":4,"offset":3996}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-16"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"验证主网部署的程序构建：","position":{"start":{"line":170,"column":1,"offset":4000},"end":{"line":170,"column":13,"offset":4012}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":170,"column":1,"offset":4000},"end":{"line":170,"column":13,"offset":4012}}},{"type":"code","lang":null,"meta":null,"value":"anchor verify -p <lib-name> <program-id>","position":{"start":{"line":172,"column":1,"offset":4016},"end":{"line":174,"column":4,"offset":4066}},"data":{"highlightId":"code-17"}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"<lib-name>","position":{"start":{"line":176,"column":3,"offset":4072},"end":{"line":176,"column":15,"offset":4084}}},{"type":"text","value":" 对应于程序的 ","position":{"start":{"line":176,"column":15,"offset":4084},"end":{"line":176,"column":23,"offset":4092}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Cargo.toml","position":{"start":{"line":176,"column":23,"offset":4092},"end":{"line":176,"column":35,"offset":4104}}},{"type":"text","value":" 文件中定义的名称。","position":{"start":{"line":176,"column":35,"offset":4104},"end":{"line":176,"column":45,"offset":4114}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":176,"column":3,"offset":4072},"end":{"line":176,"column":45,"offset":4114}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":176,"column":1,"offset":4070},"end":{"line":176,"column":45,"offset":4114}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":176,"column":45,"offset":4114}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 程序部署\r\n\r\n完成程序后，将其部署到 devnet 或 mainnet，以便用户可以进行交互。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"程序部署\" id=\"program-deployment\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n构建您的程序以生成必要的部署文件：\r\n\r\n```\r\nanchor build\r\n```\r\n\r\n这将创建一个 `target/deploy` 文件夹，其中包含：\r\n- `<project-name>.so`：程序的字节码\r\n- `<project-name>-keypair.json`：用于部署的生成密钥对\r\n\r\n> 您可以通过替换 `<project-name>-keypair.json` 文件中的密钥对来使用自定义地址。\r\n\r\n获取程序地址：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana address -k target/deploy/<project-name>-keypair.json\r\n```\r\n\r\n在 `lib.rs` 中更新 `declare_id!()` 函数为此地址，然后配置您的 `Anchor.toml`，以使用正确的目标集群和程序 ID：\r\n\r\n```\r\n[provider]\r\ncluster = \"devnet\"\r\n\r\n[programs.devnet]\r\n<project-name> = \"<PROGRAM_ID>\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n部署您的程序：\r\n\r\n```\r\nanchor deploy\r\n```\r\n\r\n这将使用 `Anchor.toml` 中指定的地址、集群和钱包作为费用支付者进行部署。\r\n\r\n### 部署失败\r\n\r\n失败的部署会创建持有 lamports 的中间缓冲账户。您将看到类似以下的恢复指令：\r\n\r\n```\r\n==================================================================================\r\nRecover the intermediate account's ephemeral keypair file with\r\n`solana-keygen recover` and the following 12-word seed phrase:\r\n==================================================================================\r\nvalley flat great hockey share token excess clever benefit traffic avocado athlete\r\n==================================================================================\r\nTo resume a deploy, pass the recovered keypair as\r\nthe [BUFFER_SIGNER] to `solana program deploy` or `solana program write-buffer'.\r\nOr to recover the account's lamports, pass it as the\r\n[BUFFER_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS] argument to `solana program drain`.\r\n==================================================================================\r\n```\r\n\r\n要恢复您的余额：\r\n\r\n- **恢复部署** 通过恢复密钥对：\r\n\r\n    ```\r\n    solana-keygen recover -o <KEYPAIR_PATH>\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n    按提示输入 12 个单词的助记词，然后使用缓冲区进行部署：\r\n\r\n    ```\r\n    solana program deploy ./target/deploy/<project-name>.so --program-id ./target/deploy/<project-name>-keypair.json --buffer ./target/deploy/<buffer>-keypair.json\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n- **关闭** 缓冲区以回收 lamports：\r\n\r\n    ```\r\n    solana program close <ADDRESS>\r\n    ```\r\n\r\n### 通过 Solana CLI 部署\r\n\r\n您可以直接使用 Solana CLI 而不是 Anchor 来部署您的程序：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana program deploy ./target/deploy/<project-name>.so --program-id ./target/deploy/<project-name>-keypair.json\r\n```\r\n\r\n在网络拥堵期间，使用以下标志可以提高部署成功率：\r\n- `--with-compute-unit-price`：以微 lamports 设置计算单元价格\r\n- `--use-rpc`：将交易发送到 RPC 而不是验证器 TPU\r\n- `--max-sign-attempts`：在区块哈希过期后最大重试次数\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Program Upgrade\" id=\"program-upgrade\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n默认情况下，`anchor deploy` 会创建一个新的程序 ID。要在保留地址和关联账户的同时升级现有程序：\r\n\r\n```\r\nanchor upgrade target/deploy/<project-name>.so --program-id <PROGRAM_ID>\r\n```\r\n\r\n如果新的可执行文件比已部署版本更大，请先扩展程序账户：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana program extend ./target/deploy/<project-name>.so <ADDITIONAL_BYTES>\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 通过 Solana CLI 升级\r\n\r\n流程保持不变：如有需要先扩展，然后部署：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana program deploy ./target/deploy/<project-name>.so --program-id ./target/deploy/<project-name>-keypair.json\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 使程序不可变\r\n\r\n您可以移除升级权限，使您的程序不可变：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana program set-upgrade-authority <PROGRAM_ID> --final\r\n```\r\n\r\n> 此操作不可逆。一旦设置，程序将无法更新。\r\n\r\n### 迁移程序\r\n\r\n迁移将程序从一个地址转移到另一个地址。CLI 会关闭旧程序并重新部署到新位置：\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana program migrate ./target/deploy/<project-name>.json\r\n```\r\n\r\n> 迁移会破坏所有现有的 PDA，因为它们是从旧的程序 ID 派生的。用户必须更新其应用程序以使用新地址，并更改任何以 PDA 为权限的代币账户的权限。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"Uploading an IDL\" id=\"uploading-an-idl\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n接口描述语言（IDL）文件提供了程序指令和账户的标准化 JSON 描述，从而简化了客户端集成。\r\n\r\n将 IDL 上传到链上，以帮助开发者集成您的程序：\r\n\r\n```\r\nanchor idl init --filepath target/idl/<program_name>.json <PROGRAM_ID>\r\n```\r\n\r\n### 升级 IDL\r\n\r\n重新部署程序后，更新链上 IDL：\r\n\r\n```\r\nanchor idl upgrade --filepath target/idl/<program_name>.json <PROGRAM_ID>\r\n```\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"已验证的构建\" id=\"verified-builds\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n已验证的构建确保部署在 Solana 上的可执行程序与您代码库中的源代码一致。此验证使开发者和用户能够确认链上程序与公共代码库完全匹配。\r\n\r\n验证过程将链上程序的哈希值与从源代码本地构建的程序进行比较，以检测版本之间的任何差异。\r\n\r\n使用 Solana CLI 构建程序可能会将特定于机器的代码嵌入到二进制文件中。在不同机器上编译相同的程序可能会生成不同的可执行文件。为了解决这个问题，请在固定依赖项的 Docker 容器中进行构建，以获得可重复的结果。\r\n\r\nAnchor 提供了处理构建和 Docker 配置的 CLI 命令：\r\n\r\n```\r\nanchor build --verifiable\r\n```\r\n\r\n验证主网部署的程序构建：\r\n\r\n```\r\nanchor verify -p <lib-name> <program-id>\r\n```\r\n\r\n> `<lib-name>` 对应于程序的 `Cargo.toml` 文件中定义的名称。","highlightedCode":{"code-0":{"lang":"text","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"anchor build"}]}]}]}]}]}},"code-1":{"lang":"text","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"solana address -k target/deploy/<project-name>-keypair.json"}]}]}]}]}]}},"code-2":{"lang":"text","hast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"pre","properties":{"class":"shiki Kiloshift","style":"background-color:#11141a;color:#f6f6f4","tabindex":"0"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"code","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"[provider]"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{"class":"line"},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"span","properties":{},"children"